<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Records that the ``.ini`` file has now been fixed (``ini._isFixed = True``)
:raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

:cpp:class:`AGRemapCore::IniFile` deliberately does not let a fixer write its own
